 "published": false,
 "title": "Swordsmithing, “The Smith’s Flame”",
 "description": "<p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#57646f;margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\"><strong>A visit to the working forge of a swordsmithing house now in its twenty-fourth generation, descended from Masamune</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#57646f;margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\"><strong>, one of Japan&#39;s three great masters. Arranged through our partnership with Arte Inc. Guests watch heated steel struck and folded into form, learn the quiet manner in which a blade is appraised, and close the visit with tea and seasonal sweets by the hearth.</strong></p>",
 "excerpt": "The Smith’s Flame 24TH-  GENERATION SMITH · LINEAGE OF MASAMUNE · KAMAKURA ",
